SUMMARY:Kyle Sanna: Everything Again Is New (Live Coding with Ensemble)
LOCATION:National Sawdust\, 80 N 6th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:Composer\, guitarist\, and live coder Kyle Sanna presents the f
 ull premiere of Everything Again Is New\, a set of algorithmic composition
 s for electronics and ensemble centered on themes of cyclical regeneration
  and renewal. Joined by Kinan Azmeh (clarinet\, bass clarinet)\, Lily Holg
 ate (violin)\, Nathan Koci (accordion)\, and Marika Hughes (cello)\, Sanna
  (guitar\, electronics) will use code to reanimate recorded fragments of h
 is own chamber orchestra work\, all while projections show the generative 
 process itself\, as text becomes sound.\nhttps://www.nationalsawdust.org/e
 vent/kyle-sanna-everything-again-is-new-live-coding-with-ensemble-1-28-202
 7\nFrom Pushpin NYC: https://pushpin.city/nyc/
