SUMMARY:BB Wisely
LOCATION:National Sawdust\, 80 N 6th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:Hark! Behold: SLEDDING\, the first full-length album from BB WI
 SELY. You might listen to this album and think it sounds unusually seasone
 d for a debut\, and you’d be dead on. That’s because the relationships
  between the three humans of this trio date back to the early 2000’s\, w
 hen iPod’s had wheels and arguing about AI was something that happened i
 n a Spielberg chat room. The musical and personal developments between Ben
 jamin Lazar Davis\, Bridget Kearney and Will Graefe have pushed forth sinc
 e those days both in overlaps with each other and on their own circuitous 
 career paths\, but never has this trio acted as a unified whole until this
  very record: SLEDDING is here and it is one fully baked potato.\nhttps://
 www.nationalsawdust.org/event/bb-wisely-2-06-2027\nFrom Pushpin NYC: https
 ://pushpin.city/nyc/
URL:https://www.nationalsawdust.org/event/bb-wisely-2-06-2027
END:VEVENT
